{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ybAzPwuZpr1793667953.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>胡塞武裝指責沙特阿拉伯空襲也門港口及市場，造成數十人傷亡，沙特及也門政府暫時未有回應。胡塞武裝又稱，也門西南部塔伊茲省有市場遭沙特盟軍施襲，至少十死、數十人傷。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.YEM.STRIKE-0730.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oyCVjgk8bU1793667950.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>胡塞武裝又宣稱過去兩日，以無人機空襲預警雷達，以及沙特東部達曼機場。</p><p></p><p>近期胡塞武裝一方面跟沙特軍方持續開戰，另一方面又跟也門政府軍在多條戰線交火，未有平息跡象。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T01:42:27.684757+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T00:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:02:32.064662+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T01:39:03.185282+00:00","content_hash":"2d0d725ac51ad3beeaf70a40b6afe5f3b7525b4b854420bc079c677b6ca8a1b1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}